{
  "name": "Brute Force (Brute)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You're able to strike with your weapons with especially brutal force. Whenever you hit with a weapon that you're proficient with and deal damage, the weapon's damage increases by an amount based on your level in this class, as shown on the Brute Bonus Damage table. You can also add the same die to the roll if you make a Strength (Athletics) check.</p><div style=\"width: 100%;\"><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><caption>Brute Bonus Damage</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Fighter Level</th><th scope=\"col\">Damage Increase</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3rd</td><td>1d4</td></tr><tr><td>10th</td><td>1d6</td></tr><tr><td>16th</td><td>1d8</td></tr><tr><td>20th</td><td>1d10</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
